---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTABlock from '../../components/CTABlock.astro';
import { site } from '../../config/site';

const inviteEmail = site.email;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Account Setup Checklist — Domain & Cloudflare | Groundwork Dental"
  description="Go live on your domain: Cloudflare account, then a nameserver change at your registrar — on a call or on your own. No registrar transfer required."
  noindex={false}
>
  <section class="bg-surface-2">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-16">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="eyebrow text-sage-dark mb-4">Client checklist</p>
        <h1 class="section-heading mb-6">Account setup checklist</h1>
        <p class="font-serif text-xl text-mid-gray leading-relaxed">
          You own the hosting. We build in your Cloudflare account. You can remove our access anytime.
          Go-live usually means a <strong class="text-charcoal font-normal">nameserver change</strong> at your current registrar — not moving the domain registration to Cloudflare. GitHub can wait.
        </p>
        <p class="font-sans text-sm text-mid-gray mt-6">
          <a href="/guides/account-setup.md" class="text-sage-dark hover:underline">Markdown version</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-10">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">

      <div id="before" class="scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal mb-6">Before go-live</h2>

        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">1. Domain registrar</h3>
        <p class="font-serif text-lg text-mid-gray leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Where you renew <code class="text-base">yourpractice.com</code> (GoDaddy, Google/Squarespace Domains, Namecheap, etc.).
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-serif text-lg text-charcoal mb-8">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Confirm you can log in</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Reply with: registrar name + can you log in? (Yes / No / Not sure)</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Don’t change nameservers or DNS yet</strong> (especially mail / MX) — that can break email</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="font-serif text-mid-gray leading-relaxed mb-10">
          Can’t find or log in? <a href={`mailto:${inviteEmail}`} class="text-sage-dark hover:underline">Email us</a> — we’ll help.
        </p>

        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">2. Cloudflare</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-serif text-lg text-charcoal">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Sign up at <a href="https://dash.cloudflare.com/sign-up" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sage-dark hover:underline">dash.cloudflare.com/sign-up</a> with a practice email (Free plan)</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Manage Account</strong> → <strong>Members</strong> → invite <code class="text-base">{inviteEmail}</code> as <strong>Administrator</strong></span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Reply when the invite is sent</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="font-serif text-mid-gray mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Prefer we drive this on Zoom? Reply and ask for a setup call — bring practice email + registrar login.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal mb-3">At go-live — nameservers only</h2>
        <p class="font-serif text-lg text-mid-gray leading-relaxed mb-6">
          We prepare everything in <strong class="text-charcoal">your</strong> Cloudflare account (copy email DNS, connect the site). Then the registrar needs one change: point nameservers at Cloudflare. You keep renewing the domain where it is today.
        </p>
        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 mb-4">
          <a href="#option-1" class="block border border-neutral-200 bg-surface-2 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-sage-dark transition-colors">
            <p class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-sage-dark mb-2">Option 1 · recommended</p>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-2">On a call together</h3>
            <p class="font-serif text-mid-gray leading-relaxed">Screenshare. You open the registrar; we walk you through pasting two nameserver values (~5 minutes).</p>
          </a>
          <a href="#option-2" class="block border border-neutral-200 bg-surface-2 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-sage-dark transition-colors">
            <p class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-sage-dark mb-2">Option 2</p>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-2">You change NS yourself</h3>
            <p class="font-serif text-mid-gray leading-relaxed">We email the exact two nameservers. You paste them at the registrar and reply when done.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="font-serif text-mid-gray leading-relaxed">
          You do <strong class="text-charcoal">not</strong> need to transfer the domain registration to Cloudflare for launch.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="option-1" class="scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal mb-4">Option 1 — On a call together</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-serif text-lg text-charcoal">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Reply to schedule a short Zoom for cutover</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Join with registrar login ready</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>We’ll give you two nameserver values to paste</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>We confirm the website and email both work</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div id="option-2" class="scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal mb-4">Option 2 — You change nameservers yourself</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-serif text-lg text-charcoal">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Wait until we say it’s ready and send the two nameservers</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>At your registrar: find <strong>Nameservers</strong> / <strong>Custom DNS</strong> / <strong>Change nameservers</strong></span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Replace the current nameservers with the two we sent</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Save and reply when done</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>We’ll confirm site + email</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal mb-4">Later — not required for go-live</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-serif text-lg text-mid-gray">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage-dark shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span><strong class="text-charcoal">GitHub</strong> — code ownership / handoff when useful</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage-dark shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">→</span><span><strong class="text-charcoal">Transfer domain to Cloudflare Registrar</strong> — optional, so renewals live next to hosting. Extra steps; skip until the site is stable.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="font-serif text-mid-gray mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          After launch, ongoing cost is usually just domain renewal (~$12–15/year). Hosting stays free.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal mb-3">Questions</h2>
        <p class="font-serif text-lg text-mid-gray leading-relaxed">
          <a href={`mailto:${inviteEmail}`} class="text-sage-dark hover:underline">{inviteEmail}</a>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABlock
    heading="Ready when you are"
    subheading="Cloudflare + a nameserver change. On a call or on your own — about 15 minutes once, then you’re live."
    primaryCTA="Get Started"
    primaryHref="/get-started"
    secondaryCTA="How It Works"
    secondaryHref="/how-it-works"
  />
</BaseLayout>
